      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: Let's denote the common ratio of the geometric sequence by \\( r \\) and the common difference of the arithmetic sequence by \\( d \\). For any positive integer \\( k \\), we have:\n\\[ a_{2k} = a_{2k-1}r \\]\n\\[ a_{2k+1} = a_{2k-1}r^2 \\]\n\\[ a_{2k+1} = a_{2k} + d = a_{2k-1}r + d \\]",
