      "text": "Step 3: Now, consider the next term in the sequence:\n\\[ a_{2k+2} = a_{2k+1} + d = a_{2k-1}r^2 + a_{2k-1}(r^2 - r) = a_{2k-1}r^2(1 + 1 - \\frac{1}{r}) = a_{2k-1}r^2(2 - \\frac{1}{r}) \\]",
      "z": 3.6493755145579074
